# Multitech Motors - Quotation & Dealer Management App

Official Android application for Multitech Motors (A unit of Shree Shyam Group) for managing vehicle quotations, free stock, and all dealer stock.

## Features
- Secure Login with Email/Password, Google Sign-In, and Biometric Fingerprint/Face ID.
- Real-time Google Sheets stock sync with lightning-fast offline caching.
- Dynamic vehicle quotation generator with cascading dropdowns (MFG Year ➔ Model ➔ Fuel Type ➔ Variant ➔ Color ➔ Ex-Showroom ➔ Discounts ➔ Billing Price).
- Professional PDF invoice generation and direct WhatsApp sharing.
- In-app automatic update checker.
